.TH "ncneofetch" "1" "v3.0.17" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
ncneofetch \- Generate low\-effort posts for r/unixporn
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\f[B]ncneofetch\f[R] [\f[B]\-v\f[R]]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\f[B]ncneofetch\f[R] renders an image (typically a distribution logo)
and displays some system information.
It is a blatant ripoff of \f[B]neofetch(1)\f[R] using
\f[B]notcurses(3)\f[R].
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\f[B]\-v\f[R]: Increase verbosity.
.SH "نکات (NOTES)"
Optimal display requires a terminal advertising the \f[B]rgb\f[R]
terminfo(5) capability, or that the environment variable
\f[B]COLORTERM\f[R] is defined to \f[B]24bit\f[R] (and that the terminal
honors RGB escapes), along with a good monospaced font supporting the
Unicode Block Drawing Characters.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\f[B]neofetch(1)\f[R], \f[B]notcurses(3)\f[R]
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
nick black \c
.MT nickblack@linux.com
.ME \c.
